From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nishith Khanna <nishithkhanna@e.email>
Date: Tue, 20 Jan 2026 19:48:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 33/33] Theme app components according to our palette

[a17: adapted to the Android 17 Settings: /e/ colours applied to the new state
 lists (incl. the new dragging state); /e/ round homepage icons mapped by key
 onto the grouped home page, with /e/ icons for new entries (accounts and
 backup, supervision, safety center); 36dp /e/ icon size kept; the
 homepageRevamp branches are dropped because the flag is gone; a17 no longer
 tints homepage icons, so the tint removal is implicit]

(cherry picked from commit 08700a2a9ec81b85b2cfc4798f035090325d8f50)
